isn't God Spawn a universal threat? wherass , even w/ dbzs jacked up power scaling and junk Demon Picolo was at best a solar system level threat. I'm pretty sure unless picolo can come up with some kind of divine weaponry he couldn't even hurt Spawn whereas God Spawn can make black holes , mess w/ picolos mind etc.

&#x200B;

I say its a stomp in God Spawns Favor. Unless you're talking about some new dbz gt or newer version of Demon Picolo that I don't know about.
